Adam Kinzinger and others have said almost

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:33.120
no Republicans believe that. Maybe a couple.
I think, you know, maybe Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:39.180
I don't know. But there is just no way that
Steve Scalise believes that. But he doesn't

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:44.520
